  To derive energy estimates for (2.1), we assume that the damping functions
  ξ1, ξ2, ξ3 are constant throughout Ω. We note that to the best of our knowledge
  there is no energy-based proof of the stability of the PML system with non-constant
  coeﬃcients (and it seems that this question is highly non-trivial). The stability
  analysis of the PML system with constant coeﬃcients is justiﬁed by the fact that
