  This result is in accordance with or extends known results: in [28] the authors prove a similar exponential
  bound with respect to the PML parameter and length for Cartesian perfectly matched layers applied to the
  acoustic wave propagation in vacuum. Since Theorem 2.11 includes also the case of non-dispersive materials
  (i.e., 𝜇 = 𝜀 ≡ 1) it extends the bound from [13] to the case of dispersive waveguides. Note that the factor 4 in
